# Lure of the Wildcat (San d'Oria) (sandoria 113): 812's reply kind. Amutiyaal has a script onTrigger (816), so an
# Event offer would alternate with it on a second talk in a row; 812 is a Progress event and plays again. The GM resets
# the quest (available, the badge taken) between the two offers.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Amutiyaal/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/812
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=118.0,0.0,84.7 job=WAR lvl=20
login
trigger Amutiyaal                         # 812
finish                                    # the badge; begun
quest Sandoria.LureOfTheWildcat available
delkeyitem RedSentinelBadge
trigger Amutiyaal                         # 812 again (Progress)
finish                                    # the badge; begun
